# Manual tests for the error handling + validation step (VS Code "REST Client" extension)
# Run the backend first: npm run dev (inside apps/backend)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# Paste a real id from the response of request 1
@ticketId = PASTE_A_REAL_TICKET_ID_HERE

### 1. Create ticket  -> 201 + ticket JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomNumber": 101 }

### 2. Missing body field  -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3. roomNumber is text  -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomNumber": "abc" }

### 4. roomNumber is a decimal  -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomNumber": 101.5 }

### 5. roomNumber out of range (0)  -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomNumber": 0 }

### 6. roomNumber out of range (10000)  -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomNumber": 10000 }

### 7. Broken JSON  -> 400 INVALID_JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomNumber": 101,

### 8. List active tickets  -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/active

### 9. Valid status change  -> 200 (the UI should update live)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "LIGHT" }

### 10. Invalid status value  -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "FLYING" }

### 11. id is not a UUID  -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/not-a-uuid/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "LIGHT" }

### 12. Valid UUID that does not exist (status)  -> 404 NOT_FOUND
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "LIGHT" }

### 13. Valid UUID that does not exist (complete)  -> 404 NOT_FOUND
# This one depends on Prisma's P2025 mapping: if you get 500 here, tell me.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/complete

### 14. Complete a real ticket  -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/complete

### 15. Unknown route  -> 404 ROUTE_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/nope
